    "consumed": "Prime Time",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Primary Effect</strong></p>\n<p>Dose last 4 Hours.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Sharpens focus and willpower at the cost of dampened emotions</li>\n  <li>-4d6 Humanity until dose wears off*</li>\n  <li>+2 to COOL and WILL stats. User's max HP not affected by the +2 WILL</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>* Humanity can not fall under 0 from taking Prime Time</em></p>\n<p><strong>Secondary (DV17)</strong></p>\n<p>\n  When the dose wears off, the user rolls\n  <strong>WILL + Resist Torture/Drugs + 1d10 against Secondary DV</strong>.\n</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>-1 Humanity Loss</li>\n  <li>-2 to COOL while addicted and not currently dosed with Prime Time.</li>\n</ul>\n"
